    "title": "Beyond the Token: What Does NFT Ownership Really Mean",
    "description": "Buying an NFT may prove that you own a token, but it does not always explain what that ownership includes. Can you use the artwork commercially? Do you receive special access, royalties, membership benefits, or permission to create something new from it? What happens to those benefits when the NFT is sold, transferred to another wallet, moved to a different platform, or disconnected from the original project?\n\nThis session explores what meaningful NFT ownership should look like for creators, collectors, and communities. It will examine how rights, benefits, payment promises, creative attribution, and ownership history can be clearly connected to an NFT so people understand what they are buying and creators can protect what they are offering.\n\nAttendees will leave with a simple framework for asking better questions, designing clearer NFT experiences, and building digital ownership that remains understandable and useful after the initial sale.",
