    "title": "Tokenizing AI Models: How NFTs Turn Decentralized Intelligence into a New Asset Class",
    "description": "What happens when AI models become tokenized, tradeable assets on-chain? This session explores how FLock.io is pioneering Real Model Assets (RMAs) \u2014 a new token class where value accrues from real AI inference revenue, not speculation. Unlike NFTs tied to static media, model tokens are non-rivalrous digital assets with infinite concurrency and deflationary mechanics via buyback-and-burn. Drawing from FLock.io's FOMO launchpad and partnerships with Alibaba Cloud Qwen, Base, and UNDP, this talk unpacks how decentralized AI training plus on-chain tokenization creates a new asset economy. Attendees will learn how AI model tokens differ from existing NFTs and RWAs, how federated learning preserves privacy while enabling collaborative model building, and why tokenized AI may be the next evolution of digital ownership. For builders, investors, and creators at the intersection of AI and NFTs.",
