    "description": "In the evolving world of NFTs, we're moving far beyond speculative flips and profile pictures. This 10-minute solo talk explores how creators, artists, and builders use NFTs for true digital ownership, community empowerment, and sustainable creator economies in 2026.\n\nI'll cover practical strategies from hype-driven launches to lasting value: verifiable provenance in generative and AI-assisted art, token-gated experiences, on-chain governance, music rights, phygital collectibles, and meaningful fractional ownership.\n\nDrawing from hands-on NFT experience\u2014including my filmmaking background with @devinteerfilms\u2014we'll review case studies focused on storytelling, interoperability, and cultural impact.\n\nYou'll gain actionable insights on avoiding pitfalls like ignoring royalties, navigating NFTs with AI and gaming, and positioning your work for broader adoption.\n\nThis session delivers a grounded, optimistic roadmap for turning NFTs into digital heirlooms and real economic opportunities.",
