    "title": "Art will save NFTs & NFTs will help Artists!",
    "description": "When I started NFT School For Artists in 2022, I didn't have much of a plan for how or exactly what my role here was, but the mission was there: help artists live off their art by using nft tech to their advantage.\nSince then, I have been speaking on many stages (NFT NYC in 24/25), educating students on this, and creating god knows how many videos for my social media, talking about something that 99% of people don't understand. \nThere were times when I said to myself, what are you doing?? Get a life, start doing something normal, and all that. But something inside me just pushed me forward. I don't know what, but I'm glad it's there.\nIn this talk, I want to share my vision of how and why I think art will save NFTs, and why NFTs will help artists to live their dreams, to do what they love, and be free.\nMy goal is to share my motivation with the audience, help them see what I see, push them in the right direction, and, most of all, give them faith in NFTs and Art.",
