    "title": "NFTs: From Digital Art to the Moon - What Comes Next?",
    "description": "As the next wave of space missions brings people back to the Moon, there is already an art gallery there! And Houston is part of it, thanks to the magic of the global NFT community. \n\nHouston will share how he became part of the MoonMars Museum, an art archive now permanently placed on the lunar surface. In 2025, he photographed the SpaceX rocket launch. And he gave first-hand, live status reports as he shared in the NFT community space with artists from around the world.  \n\nHouston will demonstrate how NFTs and digital art can create truly out-of-this-world impact. He will offer a model for how creators can use emerging NFT technologies to expand access, amplify underrepresented voices, and contribute to something lasting. \n\nAs the world looks ahead to the return of humans to the Moon, a new chapter of exploration is already underway. One that includes not only traditional technology, but also NFTs. \n\nHouston and his mom, Katie, can do a duo presentation or join a panel.",
