    "description": "In today\u2019s creator economy, women are building powerful personal brands, but most are still monetizing through platforms they don\u2019t own.\n\nThis talk explores the rise of digital feminine wealth through tokenization \u2013 where identity, audience, and influence become on-chain assets.\n\nWe\u2019ll break down how female creators are moving from brand deals and ad revenue to ownership-driven models using NFTs, social tokens, and community-based monetization.\n\nFrom \u201csoft power\u201d to financial power, this session reframes how women can build wealth in Web3, not by fitting into traditional finance systems, but by redefining them.\n\nAttendees will leave with a clear understanding of how tokenization unlocks new income streams, deeper community alignment, and long-term ownership in the digital economy, especially for female creators.",
